#: data/io.github.sachesi.chord.metainfo.xml:9
msgid ""
"Chord is a text editor built with GTK 4, libadwaita and GtkSourceView. It "
"opens files in tabs, colours the syntax of the languages GtkSourceView "
"knows, and keeps a file’s encoding and line endings as it found them."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sachesi.chord.metainfo.xml:10
msgid ""
"It finds and replaces as you type, with regular expressions if asked, goes "
"to a line and column, tells you when a file changes on disk under it, and "
"refuses to save over changes another program made unless you say so."
msgstr ""

